  "body": "v1.16.0\r\n\r\nGoals\r\n- Put tickets in a goal to group them, even across boards\r\n- Each goal shows as a pill above the lanes, with a bar showing how much is done\r\n- Click a pill to see only that goal's tickets and its details\r\n- Works in the GUI, the TUI (:goal, :ungoal, :filter goal) and the MCP\r\n\r\nLanes\r\n- Click a lane's kebab menu to open its details: rename it, describe it or delete it\r\n- Mark a lane as a \"done\"-lane, and tickets in it count as done\r\n- A lane called Done always counts as done\r\n- In the TUI: :rule done and :unrule done\r\n\r\nUpdates\r\n- The GUI tells you when a new version of epiq is out, and how to update\r\n\r\nGUI\r\n- UX, Styling"
